        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sulphate pulp, average, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sulphate pulp, average, at regional storage
na;
Synonyms: kraft pulp, Kraftzellstoff; 
UUID: 230e2c4a-876b-3e59-ab32-109400c67221
This module includes the transport of a mix of ECF, TCF and unbleached sulphate pulp from the production site to a central distribution site  within a European country.; Geography: Deliveries within Europe according to CEPI statistics. 
Location:  Deliveries within Europe according to CEPI statistics. 
Technology: Average situation
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European market sulphate pulp consumption in 2000: 14'013 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_230e2c4a-876b-3e59-ab32-109400c67221.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
